=== DIRECT CONTRASTS BETWEEN THE ORIGINAL M1 REGRESSIONS ===
All three respondent samples are disjoint; no missing model values.
Estimand: difference between high-minus-low cue effects at zero on all
three centred involvement covariates (the original reference values).
These are conditional effects, not automatically population-average effects.
Two-sided tests; Welch-Satterthwaite df; Holm across all three pairs.
95% intervals are pointwise, NOT multiplicity-adjusted.

